{"id":"e39d17458a2b0aa4","group":"16","path":"16/16-df-simple-quantification.md","title":"简单量词","display":"df-simple-quantification — 简单量词","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","label":"16-df-simple-quantification","display":"df-simple-quantification — 简单量词","depends_on":["[[16-df-beck-chevalley]]","[[16-df-finite-limits]]","[[16-df-adjoint-functors]]"],"source":"Definition 1.9.1; Definition 4.2.1, p. 233 (PDF 253)","revision_date":"2026-10-19","aliases":["16-df-simple-quantification"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"label","html":"16-df-simple-quantification"},{"key":"display","html":"df-simple-quantification — 简单量词"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"86e53aa076639692\" href=\"?note=86e53aa076639692\" title=\"16-df-beck-chevalley\">16-df-beck-chevalley</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b75e7c168ac56b22\" href=\"?note=b75e7c168ac56b22\" title=\"16-df-finite-limits\">16-df-finite-limits</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"a88937ea87ff8530\" href=\"?note=a88937ea87ff8530\" title=\"16-df-adjoint-functors\">16-df-adjoint-functors</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"Definition 1.9.1; Definition 4.2.1, p. 233 (PDF 253)"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-19"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-df-simple-quantification</span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B\">\\(p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B\\)</span> 为带提升选择的纤维化，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FinProd}(\\mathcal B)\">\\(\\mathrm{FinProd}(\\mathcal B)\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b75e7c168ac56b22\" href=\"?note=b75e7c168ac56b22\" title=\"16-df-finite-limits\">16-df-finite-limits</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>固定基底有限积及投影 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi_{I,J}:I\\times J\\to I\">\\(\\pi_{I,J}:I\\times J\\to I\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I,J,K\">\\(I,J,K\\)</span> 遍历基底对象，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u:K\\to I\">\\(u:K\\to I\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S(u,J)\">\\(S(u,J)\\)</span> 是下节正式构造的方块。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>mate 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"86e53aa076639692\" href=\"?note=86e53aa076639692\" title=\"16-df-beck-chevalley\">16-df-beck-chevalley</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AdjHom}\">\\(\\mathrm{AdjHom}\\)</span> 及其单位、余单位采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"a88937ea87ff8530\" href=\"?note=a88937ea87ff8530\" title=\"16-df-adjoint-functors\">16-df-adjoint-functors</a>。每个存在量词内的函子族及 Hom 自然双射族同时固定，所有 BC 使用该同一伴随族。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BC}\">\\(\\mathrm{BC}\\)</span> 的定义及结构参数见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"86e53aa076639692\" href=\"?note=86e53aa076639692\" title=\"16-df-beck-chevalley\">16-df-beck-chevalley</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SimpleCoprod}\">\\(\\mathrm{SimpleCoprod}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SimpleProd}\">\\(\\mathrm{SimpleProd}\\)</span> 为本原子定义的记号，其结构参数与完整条件在下文给出。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"S(u,J)\\coloneqq(u\\times\\operatorname{id}_J,\\pi_{K,J},\\pi_{I,J},u).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[S(u,J)\\coloneqq(u\\times\\operatorname{id}_J,\\pi_{K,J},\\pi_{I,J},u).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{SimpleCoprod}(p)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\n(\\exists(\\Sigma_{I,J},\\Phi^{\\Sigma,I,J})_{I,J\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B})\\Bigl[\n(\\forall I,J\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B)\\ \\mathrm{AdjHom}(\\Sigma_{I,J},\\pi_{I,J}^*,\\Phi^{\\Sigma,I,J})\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land(\\forall I,J,K\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B)(\\forall u:K\\to I)\\ \\mathrm{BC}_\\Sigma(p;S(u,J);\\Sigma_{K,J},\\Phi^{\\Sigma,K,J},\\Sigma_{I,J},\\Phi^{\\Sigma,I,J})\\Bigr],\\\\\n\\mathrm{SimpleProd}(p)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\n(\\exists(\\Pi_{I,J},\\Phi^{\\Pi,I,J})_{I,J\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B})\\Bigl[\n(\\forall I,J\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B)\\ \\mathrm{AdjHom}(\\pi_{I,J}^*,\\Pi_{I,J},\\Phi^{\\Pi,I,J})\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land(\\forall I,J,K\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B)(\\forall u:K\\to I)\\ \\mathrm{BC}_\\Pi(p;S(u,J);\\Pi_{K,J},\\Phi^{\\Pi,K,J},\\Pi_{I,J},\\Phi^{\\Pi,I,J})\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{SimpleCoprod}(p)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\n(\\exists(\\Sigma_{I,J},\\Phi^{\\Sigma,I,J})_{I,J\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B})\\Bigl[\n(\\forall I,J\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B)\\ \\mathrm{AdjHom}(\\Sigma_{I,J},\\pi_{I,J}^*,\\Phi^{\\Sigma,I,J})\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land(\\forall I,J,K\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B)(\\forall u:K\\to I)\\ \\mathrm{BC}_\\Sigma(p;S(u,J);\\Sigma_{K,J},\\Phi^{\\Sigma,K,J},\\Sigma_{I,J},\\Phi^{\\Sigma,I,J})\\Bigr],\\\\\n\\mathrm{SimpleProd}(p)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\n(\\exists(\\Pi_{I,J},\\Phi^{\\Pi,I,J})_{I,J\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B})\\Bigl[\n(\\forall I,J\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B)\\ \\mathrm{AdjHom}(\\pi_{I,J}^*,\\Pi_{I,J},\\Phi^{\\Pi,I,J})\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land(\\forall I,J,K\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B)(\\forall u:K\\to I)\\ \\mathrm{BC}_\\Pi(p;S(u,J);\\Pi_{K,J},\\Phi^{\\Pi,K,J},\\Pi_{I,J},\\Phi^{\\Pi,I,J})\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>伴随族在各自整条合取中统一选择；重索引比较由该伴随族决定。</li>\n<li>这是沿削弱投影的量化，分别解释 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exists j:J\">\\(\\exists j:J\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall j:J\">\\(\\forall j:J\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>来源：Jacobs, <em>Categorical Logic and Type Theory</em>，Definition 1.9.1; Definition 4.2.1, p. 233 (PDF 253)。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-beck-chevalley","status":"resolved","id":"86e53aa076639692","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-beck-chevalley]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-finite-limits","status":"resolved","id":"b75e7c168ac56b22","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-finite-limits]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-adjoint-functors","status":"resolved","id":"a88937ea87ff8530","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-adjoint-functors]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-finite-limits","status":"resolved","id":"b75e7c168ac56b22","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B$ 为带提升选择的纤维化，$\\mathrm{FinProd}(\\mathcal B)$，见 [[16-df-finite-limits]]。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-beck-chevalley","status":"resolved","id":"86e53aa076639692","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"mate 采用 [[16-df-beck-chevalley]]；$\\mathrm{AdjHom}$ 及其单位、余单位采用 [[16-df-adjoint-functors]]。每个存在量词内的函子族及 Hom 自然双射族同时固定，所有 BC 使用该同一伴随族。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-adjoint-functors","status":"resolved","id":"a88937ea87ff8530","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"mate 采用 [[16-df-beck-chevalley]]；$\\mathrm{AdjHom}$ 及其单位、余单位采用 [[16-df-adjoint-functors]]。每个存在量词内的函子族及 Hom 自然双射族同时固定，所有 BC 使用该同一伴随族。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-beck-chevalley","status":"resolved","id":"86e53aa076639692","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{BC}$ 的定义及结构参数见 [[16-df-beck-chevalley]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FinProd}(\\mathcal B)","display":false},{"tex":"\\pi_{I,J}:I\\times J\\to I","display":false},{"tex":"I,J,K","display":false},{"tex":"u:K\\to I","display":false},{"tex":"S(u,J)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{AdjHom}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BC}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SimpleCoprod}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SimpleProd}","display":false},{"tex":"S(u,J)\\coloneqq(u\\times\\operatorname{id}_J,\\pi_{K,J},\\pi_{I,J},u).","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{SimpleCoprod}(p)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&\n(\\exists(\\Sigma_{I,J},\\Phi^{\\Sigma,I,J})_{I,J\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B})\\Bigl[\n(\\forall I,J\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B)\\ \\mathrm{AdjHom}(\\Sigma_{I,J},\\pi_{I,J}^*,\\Phi^{\\Sigma,I,J})\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land(\\forall I,J,K\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B)(\\forall u:K\\to I)\\ \\mathrm{BC}_\\Sigma(p;S(u,J);\\Sigma_{K,J},\\Phi^{\\Sigma,K,J},\\Sigma_{I,J},\\Phi^{\\Sigma,I,J})\\Bigr],\\\\\n\\mathrm{SimpleProd}(p)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&\n(\\exists(\\Pi_{I,J},\\Phi^{\\Pi,I,J})_{I,J\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B})\\Bigl[\n(\\forall I,J\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B)\\ \\mathrm{AdjHom}(\\pi_{I,J}^*,\\Pi_{I,J},\\Phi^{\\Pi,I,J})\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land(\\forall I,J,K\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B)(\\forall u:K\\to I)\\ \\mathrm{BC}_\\Pi(p;S(u,J);\\Pi_{K,J},\\Phi^{\\Pi,K,J},\\Pi_{I,J},\\Phi^{\\Pi,I,J})\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\exists j:J","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall j:J","display":false}],"bytes":2396,"backlinks":[{"id":"66d3058a6ae62dc5","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B$ 为纤维化；相关结构分别见 [[16-df-coherent-fibration]]、[[16-df-fibred-cartesian-closed]]、[[16-df-simple-quantification]]。"},{"id":"928bcf665de24775","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{SimpleProd},\\mathrm{SimpleCoprod}$ 采用 [[16-df-simple-quantification]]。带数据参数的 $\\mathrm{BC}_\\Pi(p;S;R',\\Phi',R,\\Phi)$、$\\mathrm{BC}_\\Sigma(p;S;L',\\Phi',L,\\Phi)$ 采用 [[16-df-beck-chevalley]]；各次调用的伴随函子与 Hom 双射均在下式显式传入。$\\mathrm{AdjHom}(F,G,\\Phi)$ 及由 $\\Phi$ 产生的单位、余单位采用 [[16-df-adjoint-functors]]。"},{"id":"6a15697ec1bc8115","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B$ 为纤维化；等式、简单余积和 Frobenius 分别见 [[16-df-eq-fibration]]、[[16-df-simple-quantification]]、[[16-df-frobenius]]。"},{"id":"58e47ffb16d63410","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{RegFib}(p)$，$p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B$，采用 [[16-df-regular-fibration]]。固定 cleavage、基底有限积、纤维终对象 $\\top_L$ 与二元积 $\\wedge_L$；$u^*$ 采用 [[16-df-substitution]]，$\\Sigma_{A,B}\\dashv\\pi_{A,B}^*$ 采用 [[16-df-simple-quantification]] 的同一伴随族。所有范畴和构造在足够大的宇宙中编码。"},{"id":"eeefa02192bbb359","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"1bdcb9b14f83cac1","anchor":"ref-331","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[16-df-simple-quantification|df-simple-quantification — 简单量词]]"}],"outgoing":["86e53aa076639692","b75e7c168ac56b22","a88937ea87ff8530"]}